-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Carbon footprint calculation</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>ISO 14064 certification</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Emission reduction strategies</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base"><svg class="w-5 h-5 text-eurogold-400 drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(212,168,67,0.5)] shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-2-2a1 1 0 111.414-1.414L9 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414z"></path></svg>Verification and validation services</li></ul></div><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-euro-600 text-white heading-font text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest rounded-2xl hover:bg-euro-700 transition shadow-xl mt-2" href="/sustainability/carbon-footprint">Learn More Carbon<i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div><div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center"><div data-reveal="reveal-right" class="relative rounded-3